# (3) 所管府省庁ごとの、(2) の件数(根拠の条・項・号が変わった手続の数)と、その府省庁の手続の数に対する割合。
SELECT ?ministry (COUNT(DISTINCT ?ps) AS ?procedures) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?chps) AS ?changed)
       (ROUND(COUNT(DISTINCT ?chps) * 10000 / COUNT(DISTINCT ?ps)) / 100 AS ?percent) WHERE {
  ?ps a cpsv:PublicService ; cv:hasCompetentAuthority ?org .
  ?org skos:prefLabel ?ministry .
  OPTIONAL {
    ?ch a jpp:ProvisionChange ; jpp:affects ?ps ; dct:temporal ?per .
    ?per dcat:startDate "2025-11-01"^^xsd:date ; dcat:endDate "2026-11-18"^^xsd:date .
    BIND(?ps AS ?chps)
  }
}
GROUP BY ?ministry
ORDER BY DESC(?changed)
